y awareness campaign in the school or community.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_012', 'Secondary education', 'Social responsibility and engagement', 'Engage in community service projects addressing poverty-related issues.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_013', 'Secondary education', 'Social responsibility and engagement', 'Work collaboratively to develop action plans for tackling poverty at local or global levels.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_014', 'Secondary education', 'Entrepreneurial mindset', 'Design and implement business or social enterprise ideas in school clubs or communities.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_015', 'Secondary education', 'Entrepreneurial mindset', 'Apply budgeting, basic financial literacy and marketing.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_016', 'Secondary education', 'Entrepreneurial mindset', 'Conduct needs assessments in local communities to identify opportunities.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_SEC_017', 'Secondary education', 'Entrepreneurial mindset', 'Apply poverty alleviation strategies such as microfinance, community-based projects, social entrepreneurship.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_001', 'TVET', 'Vocational and technical skills', 'Acquire practical skills for employment in growing industries such as renewable energy, information and communications technology (ICT), construction, healthcare and sustainable agriculture.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_002', 'TVET', 'Vocational and technical skills', 'Learn technical problem solving and innovation to enhance employability.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_003', 'TVET', 'Vocational and technical skills', 'Develop entrepreneurial competencies, including business planning, marketing and financial management.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_004', 'TVET', 'Vocational and technical skills', 'Start and manage small businesses or co-operatives using sector-specific skills.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_005', 'TVET', 'Economic and business skills', 'Plan, implement and evaluate livelihood strategies for poverty reduction.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_006', 'TVET', 'Economic and business skills', 'Apply financial literacy, including budgeting, credit management and savings strategies.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_007', 'TVET', 'Economic and business skills', 'Explore income diversification, value addition and sustainable small business practices.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_008', 'TVET', 'Economic and business skills', 'Apply business registration, taxation and compliance to transition informal enterprises into formal economic activities.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_009', 'TVET', 'Economic and business skills', 'Analyse market trends and labour demands to align skills training with economic opportunities.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_010', 'TVET', 'Workforce readiness and employability', 'Develop communication and negotiation skills to succeed in the workplace and business environments.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_011', 'TVET', 'Workforce readiness and employability', 'Gain expertise in teamwork, adaptability and resilience to navigate changing labour markets.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_012', 'TVET', 'Workforce readiness and employability', 'Engage in internships, apprenticeships and work-based learning to apply skills in real-world settings.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_013', 'TVET', 'Workforce readiness and employability', 'Enhance digital skills and technological proficiency to improve employment prospects in modern economies.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_014', 'TVET', 'Social and community impact', 'Participate in community-based projects that address poverty and social development.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_015', 'TVET', 'Social and community impact', 'Learn how to apply pro-poor development strategies and engage in sustainable community enterprises.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_016', 'TVET', 'Social and community impact', 'Develop strategies for financial and social inclusion, particularly for marginalised groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG01_TVET_017', 'TVET